  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0100_3e2cc60663f3.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 148px;\" /></p><p>The point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> covers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.<br />Then, we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.<br />Or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br />Or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>in</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math><br />Thus, time taken is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>We know that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac></math><br />Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Restoration force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>m&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Then Restoration force per unit mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8773;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>87</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>"
